flowchart TB
  CI[CI: Bicep + Checkov] --> Source[Reviewed infrastructure code]
  Source --> ARM[ARM: validate / what-if / deploy]
  subgraph Company[Company subscription: platform resource group]
    ARM --> VNet
    subgraph VNet[Isolated platform VNet]
      Runner[Reserved runner subnet: no compute]
      PE[Private endpoint subnet]
      DNS[Private DNS links]
      Runner -->|HTTPS only| PE
      Runner --> DNS
    end
    PE --> KV[Key Vault: RBAC / purge protection]
    PE --> ACR[Premium container registry]
    PE --> AMPLS[Private Monitor scope]
    AMPLS --> LA[Log Analytics]
    AMPLS --> AI[Application Insights]
    KV -. Diagnostics .-> LA
    ACR -. Diagnostics .-> LA
    Publisher[Publisher identity] -. AcrPush .-> ACR
    Runtime[Runtime identity] -. AcrPull .-> ACR
  end
  OT[Plant / OT: no connection provisioned]
